lts together:**.\n   - 5806 (from step 3).\n   - 89073 (from step 6).\n   - 65927 (from step 1).\n\n   Adding these numbers together:.\n   ```.\n     0816.\n   +58073.\n   +00374.\n   ------.\n   29564.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
